      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) as renumbered the following subsection: “(2) In relation to land held under qualified title, an application for surrender and re-alienation under this Part may only be entertained if the land has been duly surveyed and in respect of which a certified plan has been approved by the Director of Survey and Mapping except where the State Authority directs otherwise either generally or in any particular case.”. Amendment of section 204d"
      }
