      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 204ga of the Code is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) Where the State Authority approves such application under subsection 204e(3), the acceptance of the approval by the proprietor under subsection 204e(4) shall also include the consent by the chargee as to the discharge of the charge and for a fresh charge to be executed and presented in respect of the titles to be issued upon re-alienation.”. Amendment of section 211"
      }
    },
