      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (10a), by substituting for the words “not less than one year and not more than three years and to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit” the words “not more than five years or to a fine not less than one hundred thousand ringgit and not more than one million ringgit, or to both”. Amendment of section 241"
