      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the words “in the land or a particular interest only” the words “, and the last known address of the proprietor if the caveat is to be expressed to bind the land itself or an undivided share in the land”. Amendment of section 324"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/eng@/~cl_46",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "46",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 324 of the Code is amended by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(4) Notwithstanding the provision of subsection 431(1), it is sufficient for the notification to be served by ordinary post and shall be deemed to have been effected at the time at which the notification would be delivered in the ordinary course of post.”. Amendment of section 325"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/eng@/~cl_47",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "47",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 325(1) of the Code is amended by inserting after the words “by a notice in Form 19g” the words “, duly attested in accordance with the provisions of section 211 notwithstanding that the provisions dealt with dealings in alienated land,”. Amendment of section 326"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/eng@/~cl_48",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "48",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 326 of the Code is amended by inserting after subsection (1a) the following subsection: “(1aa) Notwithstanding section 431, the service of notice in Form 19c may be effected by facsimile transmission to the person or body at whose instance the caveat was entered and it shall be deemed to have been duly served where there is a return acknowledgment by electronic or other means to the effect that the notice has been received by such person or body.”. Amendment of section 330"
      }
    },
